  vendorName: Industrialist Ignatius
  offerText: Allow my factories to vent a minor amount of smog through your chimney
    this hour. I will compensate you with a massive stack of bills to look the other
    way.
  acceptResultText: You take the bills as thick black smoke fills your room. You
    cough violently, only to realize the money he handed you is entirely counterfeit!
  rejectResultText: You firmly shut the chimney vent. Breathing the clean, fresh
    air of your room gives you a wonderful sense of moral and physical superiority.
